  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Language Rights in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to be viewed as a complementary initiative to the broader social inclusion programme with the overall objective to foster social inclusion through enhancing learning of official languages and enabling environment for equal use of official languages. To do so, the project will support the development of Administrative Instruction to the Law on the Use of Languages, improve capacities of the Office of the Language Commissioner and increase awareness about language rights through the tailored VocUp platform and media campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
